From: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 19:40:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] feat(rfork): make planner model identity headers
 configurable

Attach MODEL_URL, DEPLOY_STRATEGY and IS_DRAFT to all planner requests when enabled so the planner can display readable metadata alongside opaque seed keys.

Keep the feature disabled by default. Prefer the JSON boolean configuration over the RFork environment switch, which accepts 0, 1, true and false with case and surrounding whitespace ignored. Document the option and cover configuration validation and the full planner lifecycle.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 040b26138d76c501885ee6c80c3f323bda188451)
Signed-off-by: AbyssSkb <abyssskb@outlook.com>
